# Production build config for GitHub Pages.
# These two values are CLIENT-SAFE by design: the publishable key is meant to
# ship in the browser bundle, and row-level security protects all data. They are
# committed so the deployed build always has Supabase config without depending on
# GitHub Actions repository variables. (Never put sb_secret_ or ANTHROPIC keys here.)
